    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Notoficator provides real-time notifications for WooCommerce orders.</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Real-time order alerts</li>\n<li>Clean UI</li>\n<li>Lightweight</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Shortcode</h4>\n<p>Use the shortcode below to display notifications:</p>\n<p>[notoficator]</p>\n<h4>Upgrade to Pro (Coming Soon)</h4>\n<p>The Pro version will include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Change bell icon</li>\n<li>Send notifications to selected users</li>\n<li>Broadcast notifications to all users</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload plugin</li>\n<li>Activate plugin</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20plugin%20require%20woocommerce%3F\">\nDoes this plugin require WooCommerce?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, WooCommerce must be installed and active.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20this%20plugin%20lightweight%3F\">\nIs this plugin lightweight?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it is optimized for speed and performance.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update bell icon</li>\n<li>Minor bug fixes</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
